<text id="staticTxt"><![CDATA[
<span class="space">R1#<b>tampilkan rute ip statis</b></span><br/>
<span class="space">Kode: L - lokal, C - terhubung,<span class="orange">S - statis</span>, R - robek,</span><br/>
<span class="space1">M - seluler, B - BGP, D - EIGRP,</span><br/>
<span class="space1">EX - EIGRP eksternal, O - OSPF, IA - OSPF antar area</span><br/>
<span class="space1">N1 - OSPF NSSA eksternal tipe 1,</span><br/>
<span class="space1">N2 - OSPF NSSA eksternal tipe 2,</span><br/>
<span class="space1">E1 - OSPF eksternal tipe 1,</span><br/>
<span class="space1">E2 - OSPF eksternal tipe 2, i - IS-IS,</span><br/>
<span class="space1">su - ringkasan IS-IS, L1 - IS-IS level-1,</span><br/>
<span class="space1">L2 - IS-IS level-2, ia - IS-IS antar area,</span><br/>
<span class="space1"><span class="orange">* - calon default</span>, U - rute statis per pengguna</span><br/>
<span class="space1">o - ODR, P - rute statis yang diunduh secara berkala,</span><br/>
<span class="space1">H - NHRP, l - LISP, + - rute yang direplikasi,</span><br/>
<span class="space1">% - penggantian hop berikutnya</span><br/>
